WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.423
Assalamu alaikum!

00:00:02.573 --> 00:00:10.425
This short guide shows ISSV teachers how to run a virtual Sunday class with Google Classroom and Google Meet.

00:00:11.025 --> 00:00:16.125
First, make sure you’re signed in with your LearnIslam account, not a personal Gmail.

00:00:16.275 --> 00:00:23.060
The admin has already created your classes and added your students, so they’re waiting on your Classroom home page.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:31.533
Each grade has a first period class and a second period class, and each one needs its own Meet link. You only do this once.

00:00:31.683 --> 00:00:35.226
In each class, click the gear icon to open Settings.

00:00:35.376 --> 00:00:42.545
Settings opens as a new page. Scroll down to Manage Meet link, next to the Google Meet logo, and click it.

00:00:42.695 --> 00:00:46.771
Click Generate link, turn on Visible to students, and click Save.

00:00:48.145 --> 00:00:54.397
Now each class has one Meet link for every virtual Sunday. Please don’t post links anywhere else.

00:00:54.997 --> 00:00:58.113
On Saturday, post a quick reminder in the Stream.

00:00:58.263 --> 00:01:07.737
Something like: Virtual class tomorrow! Test your connection from 10:00 to 10:15. Join from the Meet link here, with your LearnIslam account.

00:01:08.337 --> 00:01:13.202
On Sunday, open the Meet at about 9:50, straight from your class page.

00:01:13.352 --> 00:01:23.295
Click the Host controls shield, and turn on Host management. Now you can mute everyone, decide who joins, and remove anyone disrupting class.

00:01:23.445 --> 00:01:28.097
Students signed in with a personal account will show up as asking to join.

00:01:28.247 --> 00:01:34.413
Check the name against your class roster before admitting, and fix any display names you don’t recognize.

00:01:34.563 --> 00:01:40.069
Before class ends, open the People panel, and take attendance from the participants listed.

00:01:40.219 --> 00:01:45.020
When class is over, click the red button, and choose End the call for everyone.

00:01:45.719 --> 00:01:48.109
Then post any homework in Classwork.

00:01:48.709 --> 00:02:00.316
That’s it! The written steps are on the Online Classes page of the school website. If a class or setting is missing, email issvsupport@learnislam.org.
